hint: Each search stays inside the piece it starts in.
right: Each search finds exactly the connected component of its start: {1, 2, 3}, {4, 5} and {6}.
wrong: 3 reaches 2, and through it 1. 5 reaches 4. 6 has no edges, so it reaches only itself.

